# Frontend 공통 환경변수
# 환경별로 다른 값은 각 .env.dev 또는 .env.prod 파일에서 설정

# API Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api

# Backend origin resolution (pick ONE depending on environment)
# - Use NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL for local development without Docker or when calling public API origin
# - Use BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL only for server-side/middleware/container-to-container access
# If both are set, BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL takes precedence in middleware/SSR.
# Examples:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8080
# BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL=http://backend:8080

# Authentication (optional)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_oauth_client_id_here

# Environment
NODE_ENV=development

# Frontend Server
PORT=3000
HOSTNAME=0.0.0.0